      "message": "I had been (perhaps misguidedly) trying to separate these two ideas:\n- SkPathData returns null if it can\u0027t build something (e.g. bad verbs, nonfinite)\n- SkPath has decided to still use a pathdata for error cases, so it makes a singleton.\n\nIt looks like you\u0027re suggesting we change this idea, and have SkPathData never return null, but have its own idea of special singleton?",
